can (Traditional), Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","review_id":"4PQm6zo6E6UAthsmXliEHA","date":"2021-05-09T15:44:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9262070059776306,"text_excerpt":"I love the convenience of the location. There isn't many eateries in New Orleans East. Their turkey burger is sooo good. Smileys Grill is a gem."},{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","review_id":"dfi2lf1eGtYePJvrTPSVQQ","date":"2017-11-08T00:45:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9108479619026184,"text_excerpt":"Oh my GOODNESS, you have to come here for the char grilled oysters. I am seriously still thinking about them in all their buttery, parmesany glory. This place is the real deal, everything we had was the bomb, but the oysters are the serious standout. The prices are really good and the portions are huge. The service was questionable but the food made sure that didn't matter. Who cares if your waitress ever comes back to check on you when you have 12 heavenly charcoaly buttery oysters?! I have to eat here again!"},{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","review_id":"uYwgjkCwfLxdrI3wnY2kqg","date":"2020-05-14T14:41:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9102565050125122,"text_excerpt":"Hidden gem of New Orleans East, came here for the first time for a fish and shrimp plate, cause you know we gotta have our seafood on Fridays, and I was surely satisfied! $11.95 (plus tax) is a good price and you get tail on shrimp! My favorite! It comes with fries and a drink and a nice sized, individually packed side salad (House or Caesar). I also got the Smiley lunch rum punch and it's got a kick to it! The bartender added an extra kick. Inside atmosphere is at home and relaxed. Can't believe it took me this long to come check"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","photo_id":"656dm-jnQiAdMY1ZK1p7Ng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/656dm-jnQiAdMY1ZK1p7Ng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9256964921951294},{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","photo_id":"sfrCEpGUPwijdx1ImsAzaw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sfrCEpGUPwijdx1ImsAzaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8492248058319092},{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","photo_id":"M9zrFagextlrI52ri9Wj2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/M9zrFagextlrI52ri9Wj2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8294805288314819},{"business_id":"XS7-OeTmDUwVVz1MSbRBRA","photo_id":"wMF0bANTD682y0AM3UlOTQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wMF0bANTD682y0AM3UlOTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.775382936000824}]},"notebook_case":null}
